/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 598 Tm (2. Discount limits) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 580 Tm (The discount is measured against the list price of the whole deal, in the first contract) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 566 Tm (year.) Tj
