/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 532 Tm (- Above 10 and up to 20 percent: Sales Manager.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 518 Tm (- Above 20 and up to 30 percent: Sales Director.) Tj
