/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 93 490 Tm (Finance.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 470 Tm (Approval is requested in the CRM before the quote is sent. A quote sent with a discount) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 456 Tm (that has not been approved is withdrawn.) Tj
