/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 410 Tm (For deals with an annual contract value above 250,000 EUR there is a discount floor: the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 396 Tm (total discount may not exceed 35 percent, whoever approves it. This floor was approved) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 382 Tm (by the executive team in June 2026.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 354 Tm (4. Multi-year contracts) Tj
