/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 322 Tm (extra approval, as long as the price is fixed for the term and paid annually in advance.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 294 Tm (5. What counts as a discount) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 276 Tm (Free months, free implementation services, extended payment terms beyond 45 days and) Tj
