/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 202 Tm (- Product features with a delivery date. Only the product team can commit to a date.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 188 Tm (- Changes to the standard contract terms. These go to Legal.) Tj
